{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26138","headline":"及第後谢座主 · 周匡物","name":"及第後谢座主","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一纵东越入西秦，十度闻莺不见春。\n试向崑山投瓦砾，便容灵沼濯埃尘。\n悲欢暗负风云力，感激潜生草木身。\n中夜自将形影语，古来吞炭是何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周匡物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}